Size takes node
Put node at "kind" into kind
If kind is "file"
Give back node at "bytes"
Otherwise
Put node at "left" into left
Put node at "right" into right
Call Size with left into left size
Call Size with right into right size
Give back left size plus right size
Yeah

Rock Readme
Readme at "kind" is "file"
Readme at "bytes" is 2

Rock Api
Api at "kind" is "file"
Api at "bytes" is 3

Rock Guide
Guide at "kind" is "file"
Guide at "bytes" is 5

Rock Docs
Docs at "kind" is "folder"
Docs at "left" is Api
Docs at "right" is Guide

Rock Root
Root at "kind" is "folder"
Root at "left" is Readme
Root at "right" is Docs

Call Size with Readme into leaf size
Call Size with Docs into docs size
Call Size with Root into root size

Print "leaf=" plus leaf size
Print "docs=" plus docs size
Print "root=" plus root size
